  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly falsified reimbursement documents and added false invoices to obtain public funds from the water bureau, using the money for personal consumption. This conduct involves the illegal appropriation of state funds by a public employee, which under Chinese criminal law constitutes the crime of embezzlement of public funds (挪用公款罪). Although the prosecution suggested fraud, the factual circumstances fit the statutory definition of embezzlement of public funds.",
